Package: @PACKAGE@
Version: @VERSION@
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: T3 Gemstone Project Development Team <support@t3gemstone.org>
Description: Edge AI remote core firmware for J722S based T3 Gemstone boards
 Vision apps firmware for the C7x DSP cores (j722s-c71_0, j722s-c71_1) and
 the main R5F core (j722s-main-r5f0_0), plus the Chips&Media Wave521c video
 codec firmware. Built with TI Processor SDK RTOS J722S 11.00.00.06.
 .
 On installation, the k3-am67a-t3-gem-o1-edgeai-apps.dtbo overlay is
 appended to the overlays= line of /boot/uEnv.txt if the overlay file is
 found under /boot. Removing the package takes it out again.
 .
 Firmware files that already exist at the same paths, such as the ones
 shipped with the board image, are diverted to <path>.distrib and restored
 when the package is removed.
 .
 A reboot is required for the remote cores to load the new firmware and
 for the overlay to be applied.
